l,"closed_at":"2026-06-19T16:54:35Z"},"comments":1,"created_at":"2026-02-26T02:53:25Z","updated_at":"2026-03-04T18:36:24Z","closed_at":"2026-03-04T17:24:02Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproduced in 4.5.1-stable\n- Reproduced in 15a4311583fbaad2eee5d2ecda5437eb9fd68c63\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.6.1.stable - Windows 10 (build 19045) - Multi-window, 3 monitors - OpenGL 3 (Compatibility) - AMD Radeon RX 6700 XT (Advanced Micro Devices, Inc.; 32.0.21030.2001) - AMD Ryzen 7 5800X3D 8-Core Processor (16 threads) - 31.91 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen this code is run:\n```\nEditorInterface.reload_scene_from_path(\"res://main.tscn\")\n```\n\nIt can very occasionally call a segmentation fault, if the user is selecting nodes in the inspector! \n\nBecause this is probably due to a race condition, it only occurs on very heavy scenes that take a while to load (i.e. lots of instancing). \n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- Open the MRP\n- Ensure that the buggy addon in `addons/foobar.gd` is running; \"Foooo\" should be printed to the console\n- Open main.tscn\n- Click on stuff in the inspector\n- Your project should crash pretty quickly. It might take a minute. Just keep clicking around...\n- If it crashes too fast or immediately upon startup, feel free to comment out the relevant line in `foobar.gd`. Then, uncomment it when you're ready to do some crashing.\n\nNote that running it in a dev build might cause the reload to go so slow that the crash never happens! If that's the case, simplify the scenes by deleting some nodes, to speed up the reload.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[test-instanced-scene-4.6.1.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/25562696/test-instanced-scene-4.6.1.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116788/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116788/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}